  // You Pee/Poop in your underwear near Penny friendship very nice

  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Soiled.Verynice.1": "$FARMERNAME$! You're <wetting&messing> your $UNDERWEAR_NAME$!$5#$b#Why didn't you tell me you needed the potty?$3#$b#*Sigh* It's okay, we can try again next time.",
