  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Soiled.Verynice.4": "%You tug on Penny's sleeve for help to go potty right before <wetting&messing> your $UNDERWEAR_NAME$.#$b#Oh no you were so close!$3#$b#I'm not mad, I know you're trying. You'll get the hang of it really soon.",
