  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Soiled.Verynice.6": "Did you have an accident in your $UNDERWEAR_NAME$ $FARMERNAME$?|You have the same potty face as Vincent.$1#$b#Do you need help getting changed like him too?#$b#%Penny tickles your tummy teasingly.",
  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Soiled.Verynice.7": "I saw that.$3#$b#$y 'Was that REALLY an accident?_Uh huh, I tried to hold it._Oh $FARMERNAME$, I know it's hard for you. I'm very proud of you for trying._I didn't wanna use the potty._$FARMERNAME$, I know it's hard for you, but you still have to try, okay?$3'",
  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Soiled.Verynice.8": "We're supposed to do that on the potty $FARMERNAME$. What happened?$3#$b#It's okay, I'm not angry. You're trying really hard. It's okay if you still have accidents sometimes.#$b#<Boys/Girls> are easy to clean!$1",

