  // you check Penny's underwear

  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Check.Npc.Clean.1": "%Penny gives you a playfully smug look as you find her completely clean.#$b#Did you really think i'd need help with my pants like Vincent or Jas?$0#$b#Of course im clean, I am responsible, unlike someone else I know.$1#$b#%Penny smirks and winks at you with a knowing look.",
