  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Check.Player.Verynice.Clean.1": "%Penny gasps playfully and claps her hands together for you as she puts on her preschool teacher voice.#$b#Woah, i'm impressed! Good job $FARMERNAME$, I'm so proud of you! I'll make sure to put a gold star on your chart.$1",
  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Check.Player.Verynice.Clean.2": "%After finding your $UNDERWEAR_NAME$ clean, Penny ruffles your hair and pinches your cheek gently as she coos at you.#$b#Goodness, i'm almost shocked! I can't tell if i'm happy or disappointed you're not a 24/7 potty pants like Vincent. Less diapers to change for me....$0#$b#But that also means I can't treat you like a helpless and adorable baby... You know you make a cute baby, right?$1#$b#%Penny grins playfully at you before returning to what she was doing.",

  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Check.Player.Verynice.1": "%Penny smiles at you as she asks in her preschool teacher voice as if she was speaking to Vincent.#$b#Aww, $FARMERNAME$ Did you have an accident again? Come here, let Miss Penny see.#$b#Penny slips a hand down your $PANTS_NAME$ and gives you a thorough check and nods her head as she says with a smile.",

  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Check.Player.Verynice.Used.1": "%Penny thoroughly checks your <wet&messy> diaper and smiles a bit.#$b#Uhh ooooh, someone didn't quite make it, did <he/she>? Its okay, don't be sad, Miss Penny is here to make it aaall better for you, okay baby?$1#$b#Now how about you follow Miss Penny so she can get you into something clean, alright honey?$1",

