  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Check.Player.Nice.1": "%Penny sighs a bit before giggling and asking playfully.#$b#$FARMERNAME$ I thought you were a big <boy/girl>? I think you can take care of yourself honey",
  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Check.Player.Nice.2": "%Penny looks unsure for a moment, but a smile slowly curls on her lips as she gives you a warm look.#$b#Awww.... You... You really want my help? Do I really feel that comfortable and trust worthy to you?$0#$b#Well... I guess I wouldn't mind... I change so many diapers when teaching that its really not much different if I change you too...$1",

