  "Villager_Reactions.Penny.Check.Player.Mean.2": "%Penny at first looks unimpressed and annoyed, but when she sees you're serious she gets a sympathetic look for a moment before coming to her senses and letting you down gently.#$b#$FARMERNAME$, no... I hardly even know you. If you really, REALLY need help changing, I think Harvey's Clinic would be better.$3",

