  "Villager_Dialoges.Penny.Change.Player.Accept.1": "Lets get that butt cleaned up!$l#$b#%Penny changes your diaper and smiles at you.",
  "Villager_Dialoges.Penny.Change.Player.Accept.2": "%Penny smiles warmly at you as you accept her offer and ruffles your hair as she says sweetly.#$b#Good choice honey, its best to let an adult help you when you make uh-ohs.$1#$b#Come on, lay down for Miss Penny.$1",
  "Villager_Dialoges.Penny.Change.Player.Accept.3": "%Penny leads you to a quiet spot before pulling out an extra thick $NEW_UNDERWEAR_NAME$ and other changing supplies.#$b#Alright honey, I know these diapers might be a little thick... But I think you really need the extra protection.$1#$b#Don't worry, no one will even be able to notice$1#$b#",

  "Villager_Dialoges.Penny.Change.Player.Refuse.1": "Do you want to play the big kid today? I can see it sagging from here!",
  "Villager_Dialoges.Penny.Change.Player.Refuse.2": "%Penny gives you a suspicious look for a moment before relenting.#$b#Okay... But if you won't let me change you, you need to change yourself.$0#$b#I'd hate to see my special <boy/girl> get a nasty rash$0",
  "Villager_Dialoges.Penny.Change.Player.Refuse.3": "%Penny rolls her eyes, sighs, and shakes her head.#$b#Despite being older, you really do act more like Vicent... Mabye even younger.$0#$b#%Penny lets you go but holds onto your shoulder for a moment longer as she warns.#$b#But if you leak <mister/missy>, don't be surprised when I treat you like a fussy baby.$5",

  "Villager_Dialoges.Penny.Change.Player.1": "%Penny goes about changing you swiftly with a practiced rhythmed as if shes done this 1000s of times. In no time at all, you're clean again.#$b#All done!$1",
  "Villager_Dialoges.Penny.Change.Player.2": "%Penny goes about cleaning you up with gentle motions. Soon you are all clean again, smelling of baby powder, and have a noticeable waddle.#$b#%Penny can't help her heart flutter as she watches you waddle and pats your fresh crinkly bottom as she coos to you#$b#Such a cute little <boy/girl>, run along now and go play, come back when you need another change, okay?$1"
